e, one failed table aborted the swap for all\n  tables after rows had already been deleted from the others.\n- Other databases (Postgres) swap the tables in after the delete whatever its outcome,\n  unchanged from master.\n- Limit the full-history window for programs without a main table to unique-key databases.\n  On Postgres the latest partition is replaced with the same window on every run, so the\n  epoch window made a new program's older events appear and then vanish; it also no longer\n  queries tableExists per program there.\n- Tests: drop class-wide lenient strictness for lenient() on the shared stubs that need it,\n  and use assertFalse instead of assertTrue(!...).\n\n🤖 AI Assisted","author":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"},"id":"f287797f58d8710fda7ac39e63b7f79a828f1f3c","tree_id":"6d6fd9867f32edf9d0261f13ff3481c03747c8ca","timestamp":"2026-10-07T10:05:04Z","committer":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/5591308","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/followers","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/gists{/gist_id}","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/repos","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/use